 "description": "Calls one read-only method on the nodes call_rpc uses and returns the node's own answer with how to check it against another source. Free, to check the nodes before you pay. No wallet. Eight read-only methods: eth_chainId, eth_blockNumber, eth_gasPrice, net_version, web3_clientVersion, net_peerCount, eth_syncing, txpool_status. For any other method, call_rpc.\n60 calls an hour per network address, per tool.\nExample: {\"chain\":\"base\",\"method\":\"eth_blockNumber\"}",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "chain": "base",
    "method": "eth_blockNumber"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
   "chain": {
    "description": "optional string \u2014 which node: eth or base. Default base.",
    "enum": [
     "base",
     "eth"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "method": {
    "description": "optional string \u2014 one of eth_chainId, eth_blockNumber, eth_gasPrice, net_version, web3_clientVersion, net_peerCount, eth_syncing, txpool_status; default eth_blockNumber",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
